FACTS ABOUT TIA PORTAL

TiaHmiGenerator/catalogue/ holds interface facts about TIA Portal: enum names and
numbers read by reflection from an installed TIA Portal, property names and values
from its exports and help, UI labels from its Properties window, and its exports
of test screens made for this project. In dependent.json, each rule says what TIA
Portal was seen to do with it.
